  "format": "suite_v1's: chat template, thinking off, 'Answer:' prefilled; the context, a newline, the question and 'Answer with a single word and nothing else.' in one user turn",
  "prompts": "base; each source (dissoc, same, redigit) with its own context and question; hop1 (cue -> entity) and hop2 (the lookup with the entity named / the recalled fact) for RL and RR; alias (surface form -> English entity) for RL and DL in xlang / syn; every step with the base context",
  "judge": "the first answer of the prompt's kind in the first non-empty line of 8 greedy tokens (digits, number words and ordinals for digits; the domain's English names otherwise; hop1 in xlang / syn also the surface form, matched case-sensitively)",
