  "gate": "an alias condition enters the patching runs iff, in its domain on main (400 scenes per file), the base prompt's Wilson 95% lower bound is >= 0.80 in both lookup families (RL and DL), the English baseline passes pointer_v1's rule (lower bound >= 0.85) in the same cells, and at least 35 scenes are eligible (every prompt of every family right, in both conditions; 35 is the n at which a control with no change can have a Wilson upper bound <= 0.10, as pointer_swap's rule asks).",
